            <div xml:id="m-73b36392-cd77-4d79-9b17-261923aeaf1a">
              <lg xml:id="m-41f21178-deef-431b-b8e2-4aaef27f5ee2">
                <l xml:id="m-e2c5de0b-2377-43df-82ab-7f4022ba4cfe" facs="#m-49a55c6f-af06-434e-b9e6-daa4a16ccad6" label="text-like">Monday and Tuesday after Quinquagesima.</l><l xml:id="m-d6dca833-460e-4582-a2c5-689aa7de31fa" facs="#m-bc05dceb-07dd-40c4-820f-cac1f771a2de" label="ambiguous">817</l><l xml:id="m-d4c8b664-6680-4b56-b675-66251ca5703b" facs="#m-5fa723cc-b8e6-4d33-a15f-0c1015523260" label="lyrics-like">ut víde-am. Et Jésus á- it fl-li : Réspi-ce, fides tú-a</l><l xml:id="m-af7361e9-0309-4302-ab0c-5524bd8e3540" facs="#m-371efe1e-1831-4ce4-b8b6-67e6e1888d7a" label="lyrics-like">te sálvum fé-cit. Et conféstim vi-dit, et sequebá-tur fl¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4b22c04-5032-44e0-82fe-f24f9c85fed4" facs="#m-cdcf4d3d-47e2-494c-820d-a328412b18f7" label="lyrics-like">lum, magní-fi-cans Dé- um. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-08344cb9-85fe-45ba-85a9-fbf09518f28b" facs="#m-99bde926-5ebb-4732-ad71-5dc229cf01a7" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat I. D. p. 207. Prayer. Preces nostras. p. 5</l><l xml:id="m-d943f1d3-4925-460b-8fd0-8295d8ebc9b8" facs="#m-fad435e6-2506-4f26-b9da-9ae1e9269f30" label="text-like">Monday and Tuesday after Quinquagesima.</l><l xml:id="m-6c922415-ff7e-4d68-b786-b6e9d4c9e114" facs="#m-c96838fc-f81b-4f24-89a1-e5338bef82fd" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-a877d005-2dfe-41cb-b8ee-7750ebecf7aa" facs="#m-494de305-b21e-4b07-b78b-d4d69fdeae8c" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms: Monday, p. 280, Tuesday. p. 285. In a ferial</l><l xml:id="m-408af796-1ed5-4b73-95b7-69df33eb3dd2" facs="#m-f1920ddf-6392-4828-ac76-d623f2380df1" label="text-like">omce. the follouing is said:</l><l xml:id="m-95cb526a-88fb-466f-a387-680d1e95d927" facs="#m-9a20a65e-0a65-429d-a63d-622db937b7dc" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-da2dd5f3-2a20-4f8a-a640-c9d662674882" facs="#m-028f55eb-6f9a-41ce-a779-7b701c92a5a1" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-0beea4ad-7431-45dd-8f95-33fc736f5a64" facs="#m-cca96f1b-52b2-4089-a577-5a1a0e71d243" label="lyrics-like">DEnedictus Deus, et Pater Dómi¬ consolatiónis, * qui consolátur no¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1b84644-248d-4d25-9b2e-3d58b8f83bb7" facs="#m-63fdbec5-2468-4c1e-a03c-8e533c7ef506" label="lyrics-like">in omni tribulatióne nostra.</l><l xml:id="m-7f6f0b3d-4857-47cd-ac9f-ebc89cdedc2c" facs="#m-ba375154-6bf0-48c0-984f-7c67c544834d" label="ambiguous">D ni nostri Jesu Christi, t Pater</l><l xml:id="m-08dfe2a3-1e61-4aa6-bbf6-0c990ddd77dd" facs="#m-55f3c503-4e40-4acb-b4c0-b8527993ae31" label="lyrics-like">misericordiárum, et Deus totius</l><l xml:id="m-563d36e4-7280-44bb-a2f9-758de8507329" facs="#m-a7241b3b-2941-4c3b-922d-0168933ca170" label="ambiguous">Monday.</l><l xml:id="m-8425b94f-e17e-4c06-a6a6-d77992188080" facs="#m-0ae9fc8d-2797-46d3-b8e7-9409c5a0634b" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-b0823056-0a4d-471d-8281-6c2f882a4dfc" facs="#m-80e8323d-2f41-4a88-b4df-236577b76be4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-c79a92ce-ce32-497f-8b26-0e95cb65b068" facs="#m-3ccea19d-eefd-45cb-a011-79835f45156b" label="lyrics-like">Mménse caéli Cóndi-tor, Qui míxta ne confúnde¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c6efe32-8c21-4f68-80e3-fb3222d79498" facs="#m-c9f14b0b-82ed-43e6-9855-fa2e80ba72fe" label="lyrics-like">rent, Aquae flu-énta dí-videns, Caélum dedisti lími-tem:</l><l xml:id="m-9ad78288-8c80-4d44-a5d8-51959273601b" facs="#m-95909f18-fb01-4217-ba3d-98ca42cc55a9" label="lyrics-like">Lúcem fides adáugeat:</l><l xml:id="m-a3b6b8e9-5218-4324-a16e-db67a9778050" facs="#m-38d2847d-285d-4bd5-8106-e72a1ea37cc4" label="lyrics-like">Firmans lócum caeléstibus,</l><l xml:id="m-a2a499f2-dad7-434d-aafb-1ec514a94087" facs="#m-874e5458-ef97-44f1-a62e-953f3c2e4715" label="lyrics-like">sic lúminis júbar férat,</l><l xml:id="m-6e7fc1ee-d9be-4569-be40-1e946d59ccd8" facs="#m-b8536296-2535-4313-9f03-5d456f95108e" label="lyrics-like">Simúlque térrae rivulis:</l><l xml:id="m-1da7c98f-440b-47c5-a4f2-270fa238b06b" facs="#m-a262988f-4a9a-475c-9a4d-775ef10c00dc" label="lyrics-like">Haec vána cúncta próterat,</l><l xml:id="m-26409592-28ec-49bd-89b5-91c4224036ba" facs="#m-8e943c9d-c0c4-40e2-a044-4094cffc52c6" label="lyrics-like">Ut únda flámmas témperet,</l><l xml:id="m-32480594-42c4-41ae-9257-4209168601ef" facs="#m-57abba27-b683-48ab-af55-84f9b290b6fa" label="lyrics-like">Hanc fálsa núlla cómprimant.</l><l xml:id="m-0a5bb1b7-7d3f-4376-a1c0-550a38c6513e" facs="#m-683a3bbc-5f0a-4a98-a330-50201649cb62" label="lyrics-like">Térrae sólum ne dissipent.</l><l xml:id="m-1246c21a-70be-4c21-bf01-ea5f4aea3754" facs="#m-5e990c5b-6223-43e0-a89f-21bce7c0890b" label="lyrics-like">Praésta, Páter piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-a5aee3ee-55e8-447f-bd89-12a381922258" facs="#m-91218c57-d557-4cfa-963e-bcfcc40e482a" label="lyrics-like">Infúnde nunc, piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-5980c77a-edd5-42d0-a73a-55f5a8cef183" facs="#m-30c268b9-e043-40aa-afe1-af8dd4830144" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-e57635ce-9291-4ea6-828a-aec5c3ed4a44" facs="#m-e9bc46c5-acff-467a-96d0-46fbf1148258" label="lyrics-like">Dónum perénnis grátiae:</l><l xml:id="m-076a3e78-9a5e-4f56-8f56-715fcfdb5ada" facs="#m-9e50c5d9-1e02-45a5-9a16-fdc279f8ecfb" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spíritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-40041cfe-4f80-459d-af14-9daf6055eb37" facs="#m-998bb9ad-b5e3-4c2a-bcc5-52e5c1d75415" label="lyrics-like">Fráudis nóvae ne cásibus</l><l xml:id="m-d61856c1-0baa-4367-b18f-436d890da010" facs="#m-f5c2da06-af9c-4186-95ee-11628a2513f1" label="lyrics-like">Nos érror átterat vétus.</l><l xml:id="m-f0e927ff-28cd-4b9c-9a63-b8218fed3f47" facs="#m-ac0fb77f-a541-4d58-b853-a4a4c86fc592" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-d338be2e-5dbe-4f43-bfd0-796942b597d4" facs="#m-0423d5bb-4f84-43d2-b189-beb3dd816ea1" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>